<%- include('partials/header') %><section class="prose"><% if(page==='about'){ %><span class="eyebrow">STARTING LOCAL</span><h1>A home for your next chapter.</h1><p>PG Dekho helps students, interns and working professionals explore PG accommodation in <%= localities.join(", ") %>, Bengaluru.</p><p>We are onboarding owners. Owner listings are reviewed before publication. The separate Rajanukunte public directory links to externally listed PGs without PG Dekho verification or approval. No fictional listings or stock property photos are used.</p><h2>Know what review means</h2><p>Publication review checks submitted information and photo permissions. It does not guarantee room quality, verify identity or imply a physical inspection. Always visit and confirm details yourself.</p><% }if(page==='contact'){ %><h1>Let's start a conversation.</h1><p>For a property question, use its inquiry form. You need an account so the owner can respond to your email.</p><p>For inaccurate listing details, use the report form on that property's page. Reports are available to administrators for review.</p><p>A general support email has not been configured for this launch. No emergency assistance is provided through this platform.</p><% }if(page==='privacy'){ %><h1>Privacy at PG Dekho</h1><p>We store your name, email, password hash and role to operate your account. Session cookies keep you signed in and protect forms.</p><p>When you send an inquiry, your name, email, message and optional visit date are shared with the property's owner. Only you and that owner can view the inquiry through their dashboards.</p><p>Owner contact details are public only with their publication authorization. Administrators can review submitted property information, uploaded photographs, permissions and reports.</p><p>Photos are re-encoded and metadata removed. Please do not upload identification documents or images of people without consent. Uploaded photos are retained for listing management until removed by the owner.</p><p>The public directory stores business names, broad addresses and linked source references. Directory details are not a live feed and may be outdated. OpenStreetMap embeds load from a third party and receive your IP address and browser information. Map and source links open the selected provider under its privacy policy.</p><p>We do not provide advertising trackers or payment processing. Account data remains in the configured database until removed by the operator. Before a public launch, the operator must publish a support contact and establish retention and account deletion procedures.</p><% }if(page==='terms'){ %><h1>Using PG Dekho</h1><p>PG Dekho is an accommodation discovery and inquiry platform. It does not currently accept bookings, rent payments or deposits.</p><p>Owners must provide accurate property information and publish only photographs they own or are authorized to use. Misleading content may be rejected or unpublished.</p><p>Rent, deposits, meals and availability must be confirmed directly with the owner. Sending an inquiry does not reserve a room or confirm a visit.</p><p>Publication review does not constitute an inspection, identity verification or quality guarantee. Visit properties and assess terms before committing.</p><p>This initial application is intended for adult users. The operator must complete the contact, privacy and operational arrangements before opening a public service.</p><% } %></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>